# ============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
# ============================================================================
# [ ] Replace server_name with actual domain or IP (167.86.108.197)
# [ ] Adjust BASEPATH if app is not served at root (e.g., /admin)
# [ ] Copy to /etc/nginx/sites-available/naturaloptions
# [ ] Create symlink to sites-enabled
# [ ] Test config: nginx -t
# [ ] Reload Nginx: systemctl reload nginx
# [ ] Verify PM2 app is running: pm2 status
# [ ] Test HTTP access: curl -I http://167.86.108.197/
# [ ] Monitor logs: tail -f /var/log/nginx/naturaloptions_*.log
# [ ] When ready for SSL:
#     [ ] Install certbot: apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx
#     [ ] Obtain certificate: certbot --nginx -d admin.example.com
#     [ ] Uncomment HTTPS server block
#     [ ] Uncomment HTTP to HTTPS redirect
#     [ ] Update SSL certificate paths
#     [ ] Test and reload Nginx
# [ ] Set up log rotation for Nginx logs if not already configured
# [ ] Consider adding fail2ban rules for repeated 429 (rate limit) responses
# [ ] Monitor performance: nginx -V to check if compiled with http_v2_module
